IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ea-offences`

-- Electricity Act 2001, what I may do and what I can be charged with, from the occupier's seat -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_electricity-act-2001_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`I replace a lamp at home` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `replacing a lamp`
    `the installation is my own` IS TRUE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS FALSE

`I replace a lamp at my neighbour's` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `replacing a lamp`
    `the installation is my own` IS FALSE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS FALSE

`I add a socket at home` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `adding or altering wiring, sockets or switches`
    `the installation is my own` IS TRUE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS FALSE

`I add a socket at home under a licensed electrician's supervision` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `adding or altering wiring, sockets or switches`
    `the installation is my own` IS TRUE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS TRUE

`I rewire the plug of my kettle` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `repairing an appliance plugged into a socket`
    `the installation is my own` IS TRUE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS FALSE

`as a lift mechanic I work on a live control circuit` MEANS `My electrical job` WITH
    `the job` IS `repairing a machine in my non-electrical trade, on a circuit that is or may be connected to supply`
    `the installation is my own` IS FALSE
    `I am a licensed electrical worker and my licence covers it` IS FALSE
    `I act under the supervision of a licensed electrical worker` IS FALSE

`digging a garden pond near a low voltage cable, no detection` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `excavating earth, rock or other material`
    `the cable nearby` IS `a licensee's low voltage cable`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS FALSE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 0
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS FALSE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS FALSE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS FALSE

`digging a garden pond near a low voltage cable, after licensed detection` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `excavating earth, rock or other material`
    `the cable nearby` IS `a licensee's low voltage cable`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS FALSE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 0
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS FALSE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS TRUE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS FALSE

`piling near a high voltage cable on 6 days' notice` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `boring, levelling, piling or tunnelling by mechanical means`
    `the cable nearby` IS `a licensee's high voltage cable, or infrastructure housing a transmission cable`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS FALSE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 6
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS TRUE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS TRUE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS TRUE

`piling near a high voltage cable on 7 days' notice with every step` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `boring, levelling, piling or tunnelling by mechanical means`
    `the cable nearby` IS `a licensee's high voltage cable, or infrastructure housing a transmission cable`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS FALSE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 7
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS TRUE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS TRUE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS TRUE

`digging out a gas leak near a high voltage cable` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `excavating earth, rock or other material`
    `the cable nearby` IS `a licensee's high voltage cable, or infrastructure housing a transmission cable`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS TRUE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 0
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS FALSE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS FALSE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS FALSE

`driving a fence post where there is no licensee's cable` MEANS `My earthworks` WITH
    `the kind of work` IS `driving a bar, rod, pole, picket, casing or tube into the ground`
    `the cable nearby` IS `no licensee's cable in the vicinity`
    `I have reasonable cause to believe it is necessary for public or private safety` IS FALSE
    `days of written notice I gave the licensee before starting` IS 0
    `the notice period in days, 7 unless the Authority modified it` IS 7
    `I obtained the cable location from the licensee and consulted it` IS FALSE
    `a licensed cable detection worker carried out cable detection work` IS FALSE
    `I met the licensee's reasonable requirements, took precautions and allowed it access` IS FALSE

`a holed meter cover in my custody` MEANS `My meter` WITH
    `a device or wire was attached to or near it to alter or stop its registering` IS FALSE
    `its covering had a hole that is not ordinary wear and tear` IS TRUE
    `a licensee's seal on it was damaged, removed or changed` IS FALSE
    `a licensee's paint or compound on a screw or part was damaged, removed or altered` IS FALSE
    `a test link on its terminal test block was moved` IS FALSE
    `I had custody or control of it at the time` IS TRUE

`a broken seal on a meter in a common corridor not in my control` MEANS `My meter` WITH
    `a device or wire was attached to or near it to alter or stop its registering` IS FALSE
    `its covering had a hole that is not ordinary wear and tear` IS FALSE
    `a licensee's seal on it was damaged, removed or changed` IS TRUE
    `a licensee's paint or compound on a screw or part was damaged, removed or altered` IS FALSE
    `a test link on its terminal test block was moved` IS FALSE
    `I had custody or control of it at the time` IS FALSE

`an untouched meter in my custody, with a low bill` MEANS `My meter` WITH
    `a device or wire was attached to or near it to alter or stop its registering` IS FALSE
    `its covering had a hole that is not ordinary wear and tear` IS FALSE
    `a licensee's seal on it was damaged, removed or changed` IS FALSE
    `a licensee's paint or compound on a screw or part was damaged, removed or altered` IS FALSE
    `a test link on its terminal test block was moved` IS FALSE
    `I had custody or control of it at the time` IS TRUE

§ `s 2 -- voltage`

#ASSERT NOT `Is the cable high voltage` `alternating current` 230 230
#ASSERT `Is the cable high voltage` `alternating current` 900 601

§ `ss 2 and 82 -- electrical work`

#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `I replace a lamp at home` EQUALS `yes: section 82(8) saves it`
#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `I replace a lamp at my neighbour's` EQUALS `no: it is an offence under section 82(7)`
#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `I add a socket at home` EQUALS `no: it is an offence under section 82(7)`
#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `I add a socket at home under a licensed electrician's supervision` EQUALS `yes: I am supervised by a licensed electrical worker`
#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `I rewire the plug of my kettle` EQUALS `it is not electrical work under section 2`
#ASSERT `May I do this electrical work myself` `as a lift mechanic I work on a live control circuit` EQUALS `no: it is an offence under section 82(7)`

#ASSERT `Do I commit an offence by engaging this person for electrical work` FALSE TRUE

§ `ss 79 and 80 -- earthworks`

#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `digging a garden pond near a low voltage cable, no detection` EQUALS `an offence under section 79(5): up to $10,000 or 12 months or both`
#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `digging a garden pond near a low voltage cable, after licensed detection` EQUALS `allowed: I took the steps the section requires`
#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `piling near a high voltage cable on 6 days' notice` EQUALS `an offence under section 80(7): up to $100,000 or 5 years or both`
#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `piling near a high voltage cable on 7 days' notice with every step` EQUALS `allowed: I took the steps the section requires`
#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `digging out a gas leak near a high voltage cable` EQUALS `allowed for safety: written notice to the licensee is due within 7 days of starting`
#ASSERT `May I carry out these earthworks` `driving a fence post where there is no licensee's cable` EQUALS `sections 79 and 80 do not apply`

#ASSERT `Can I rely on the section 80(9) defence` TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Can I rely on the section 80(9) defence` TRUE TRUE 10 FALSE

§ `ss 72, 79 to 89 and 92 -- maxima`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can get for` `s 6(2) an unlicensed activity` EQUALS `Maximum penalty` OF (JUST 500000), NOTHING, (JUST 12500)
#ASSERT `What is the most I can get for` `s 83(2) wilfully tampering with an installation so as to endanger life or property` EQUALS `Maximum penalty` OF NOTHING, (JUST 60), NOTHING
#ASSERT `What is the most I can get for` `s 82(7) unlicensed electrical work, or knowingly engaging an unlicensed person` EQUALS `Maximum penalty` OF (JUST 10000), (JUST 12), (JUST 250)
#ASSERT `What is the most I can get for` `s 85A damaging a submarine cable` EQUALS `Maximum penalty` OF (JUST 2000000), (JUST 60), NOTHING

§ `s 87 -- stealing electricity`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for stealing electricity` 20000 0 EQUALS 110000

#ASSERT `Am I presumed to have tampered with my meter` `a holed meter cover in my custody`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I presumed to have tampered with my meter` `a broken seal on a meter in a common corridor not in my control`
#ASSERT NOT `Am I presumed to have tampered with my meter` `an untouched meter in my custody, with a low bill`

§ `ss 91, 93, 94, 96`

#ASSERT `Am I guilty of my company's offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `Can my offence be compounded for this sum, if the Authority so chooses` TRUE 3500

#ASSERT `Must I report the accident to the Authority` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `May I alter the installation or the accident site` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

#ASSERT `What will follow my report of the accident` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `the officer's findings go to the Public Prosecutor, and an inquiry follows whose findings go there too`

#ASSERT NOT `Can I be arrested under section 96` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE

